node_modules/
dist/
.superpowers/
src-tauri/target/
.env
*.local
DS_Store

# Release-gate output and scratch logs. Regenerated by pnpm test:coverage and
# pnpm test:e2e; they are evidence, not source.
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
*-log.txt

# Local scratch and build pollution. The %SystemDrive% tree is copied Windows cache
# data left behind by a build step, not project content; it must never be committed.
review-artifacts/
report.tmp
# Stray duplicate of .agents/ left behind by skill tooling. The canonical skill copy is
# .agents/ (the path skills-lock.json points at), so this directory is never committed.
agent/
docs/reviews/*
# The hardened release smoke record is a deliverable and stays tracked.
!docs/reviews/2026-09-24-shura-hardening-smoke.md
# DECISION (2026-10-12, Q6 in docs/plans/2026-10-05-production-readiness-plan.md): review
# documents are working notes and stay local on purpose. The release-facing facts they produced are
# carried into the tracked plan, the progress file and CHANGELOG.md, so nothing here is a lost
# deliverable. Add a negation only if a future review must ship with the release.
%SystemDrive%/
.claude/handoffs/
